# Groq API Configuration
# Get your free API key from: https://console.groq.com
# 
# IMPORTANT: 
# - Never commit this file with your actual API key!
# - Copy this file to .env and add your real key
# - The .env file is in .gitignore and won't be committed
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env (or copy on Windows)
# 2. Get API key from https://console.groq.com
# 3. Replace the placeholder below with your actual key
# 4. Save the file
#
# Your API key should start with: gsk_

GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
